    <Description>Chosee group of pokemon. this script handle around.
Tips:
Using tamer Takeru (Full Healing Skill) or change slot 8 on tamer slot to your food. 
Using Jogress Digimon or any digimon kill with 1 skill.
place your digimon skill in F1 (digimon skill slot)
Tested on File Island and Maze work perfectly. Why? 
Because File island is good for leveling digi lvl 50-90, maze to 99
i already using this for full 10 hours.
Dont ask about antimacro this not designed for it. I suggest chose those 2 location because now people not go there too much, almost empty.
it is safer if you using this macro while playing with your phone. its helping me so much for make Susanoo
 TIME is = TERA = MONEY XD

@masterpiecetech</Description>
